# No automatic build verification

Do **not** run build, compile, or dev-server commands to verify changes unless the user explicitly asks. User is already likely running a dev server and does not need your additional check. You can run tsc.

If verification seems necessary, ask the user or rely on their running dev server instead of starting one yourself.
